00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:17.150
If I say the word
"constrained device,"

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:18.770
does anyone know what that is?

00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:19.700
A constrained device?

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:21.550
Couple of people
