All right.

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:38.880
So if you remember, the entry
point into Cloud IoT Core

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:41.310
is Google Cloud Pub/Sub.

00:20:41.310 --> 00:20:46.650
And so before we can receive
messages and transmit--

00:20:46.650 --> 00:20:49.410
and before we can
transmit messages and then

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:51.190
process those
messages from Pub/Sub,

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:55.410
we have to create a Google
Cloud Pub/Sub topic.

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:58.000
So I'm going to create a
Google Cloud Pub/Sub topic.

00:21:06.010 --> 00:21:08.440
I'm super nervous,
so I type really bad.

