OK.

00:21:09.424 --> 00:21:12.780
[INAUDIBLE]

00:21:12.780 --> 00:21:15.730
OK, so I just typed in
gcloud pubsub topics

00:21:15.730 --> 00:21:19.870
creates io2018, top for topic.

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:25.970
And so now I do gcloud
pubsub subscriptions.

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:29.070
So the subscriptions
will-- of course, my--

00:21:32.458 --> 00:21:37.820
got sub, and I forget the help.

00:21:37.820 --> 00:21:40.370
All right.

00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:42.290
So when you create
the subscription,

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:45.830
you have to associate that
subscription with a topic.

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:52.361
And then I have to add create.

00:21:52.361 --> 00:21:53.860
And if you see me
struggling up here

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:55.650
and know how to
fix what I'm doing,

00:21:55.650 --> 00:21:57.794
