00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:32.830
So you give us your
public key, and then

00:23:32.830 --> 00:23:34.720
you encrypt your data
with your private key

00:23:34.720 --> 00:23:38.980
when you authorize it, and
you get a JSON Web Token.

00:23:38.980 --> 00:23:43.720
And so what this is going to
do is invoke a couple of--

00:23:43.720 --> 00:23:46.180
