is doing is just

00:23:48.700 --> 00:23:51.010
calling this OpenSSL
command, which

00:23:51.010 --> 00:23:55.066
will generate a
public-private key pair

00:23:55.066 --> 00:23:57.880
with JWT-compatible algorithms.

00:23:57.880 --> 00:24:01.240
And so now that I
have my device keys,

00:24:01.240 --> 00:24:05.035
