00:24:19.700 --> 00:24:22.060
example, you can find
this in the documentation

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:25.340
at cloud.google.com/iot.

00:24:25.340 --> 00:24:31.070
And so when I
create this device,

00:24:31.070 --> 00:24:35.870
I'm going to use the EC_KEY
that was created with OpenSSL.

00:24:35.870 --> 00:24:39.080
And then I give it the ES256
string representing the type,

00:24:39.080 --> 00:24:42.740
because that is just
the signing type that's

00:24:42.740 --> 00:24:44.880
correctly named for JWT.

00:24:47.580 --> 00:24:50.040
And after this comes
back, then we're

00:24:50.040 --> 00:24:54.090
